      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should frame the 5% result as an implementation milestone that you will scale, and explain that the 20% target was a theoretical ideal based on optimistic growth curves rather than a guaranteed minimum. Acknowledging this gap honestly demonstrates strategic integrity and allows you to present the new funding as the catalyst needed to overcome local logistical barriers and achieve that original promise. This approach shows funders you are data-driven and capable of pivoting tactics to deliver value, which is far more compelling than pretending the performance is complete.",
