      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I recommend framing the 5% result not as a \"miss,\" but as a \"proven baseline\" that has validated your unique methodology and de-risked the high-impact potential of the next phase. By explicitly showing that these modest initial gains were the strategic prerequisite for accelerating massive scale later, you reposition the data as a smart, conservative step rather than a failure. This narrative proves you are a resilient, high-performing partner who will strategically deploy the new funds to unlock the very high 20% (or 25%) impact you aim to deliver without bias.",
